	(gr_text "FABRICATION\nJLCPCB 4 layers, 1.6 mm, stackup JLC04161H-7628, 1 oz outer / 0.5 oz inner, ENIG. Board 70 x 90 mm.\nVias tented; open vias: the 4 exposed-pad vias of IC4 (in the gaps of its paste grid), the thermal vias of IC8 and IC9,\nand the vias in the bottom pads of IC5 (VIN+/VIN-) and C31 (hand-soldered).\nImpedance control +-10 %: L1/L4 100 ohm differential, 0.21 mm / 0.19 mm gap (Ethernet TRD*, CSI DPHY0_*, DPHY1_*);\nL1/L4 90 ohm differential, 0.24 mm / 0.15 mm gap (USB). Min track 0.1 mm, min clearance 0.1 mm, min via 0.45/0.2 mm.\nF1-F3 and J2 sit 0.35 mm from the edge: no V-score along those edges.\n\nASSEMBLY\nAll fine-pitch parts are on the top: reflow the top side only.\nBottom side by hand (iron / hot air): IC5, J1-J4, J6, C20, C25, C26, C31, C32, C34-C36, C39, F1-F3, R21-R27.\nIC5 (Ag59824-LPB) never goes through reflow hanging upside down. Hot air profile: peak 230-245 C,\n30-90 s above 217 C, soak 150-180 C 30-90 s, ramp up <= 3 C/s, down <= 6 C/s.\nThrough-hole parts IC3 (MagJack), J6, J7, J9, J13 and C20 by hand.\nL1: dot = pad 1 (+1V1).\nCM5: M2.5 screws from below (head <= 4.5 mm), nuts on the CM5 side. Mounting holes H1-H4: M2.\n\nTEST\nPoE isolation: 1500 V 10/700 us impulse test only, at normal air pressure. No 1500 Vrms or 2250 Vdc hipot\n(Y-caps C21/C24 and the module are not rated for it). Then >= 2 MOhm at 500 Vdc, primary to GND."
		(at 160 48.45 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "0297409f-4181-4257-b79e-0c4e3c6bd988")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "Note: Rohrdurchmesser: 74,5mm\n      Max. PCB Länge: 110mm"
